  "id": "COMPOUND:20369 - PROTEIN:5852",
  "verbalization": "The visible evidence suggests a potential mechanism by which Tectoruside may interact with BT-474 through a series of molecular targets. Tectoruside is implicated in targeting VMRC-LCP and Neridienone A, both of which are involved in the regulation of BT-474. These targets are likely part of a signaling pathway that influences cellular processes critical to the survival and proliferation of BT-474 cells. The presence of a final score above 0.5 in multiple paths indicates a consistent and plausible biological relationship, though the exact nature of the interaction remains to be fully elucidated. The evidence supports a mechanistic link between Tectoruside and BT-474, but further experimental validation is required to confirm the specific molecular interactions and functional consequences.",
